<a href="footer-manager.html" class="cms-nav-item"><i class="fas fa-list-alt"></i><span>页脚管理</span></a>
<a href="comment-management.html" class="cms-nav-item"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i><span>评价管理</span></a>
<a href="media-library.html" class="cms-nav-item active"><i class="fas fa-photo-video"></i><span>媒体库</span></a>
<a href="friend-link-management.html" class="cms-nav-item"><i class="fas fa-link"></i><span>友情链接</span></a>
